PREVIOUS GENERATED PAYLOAD (edit this; do NOT output full HTML):
<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<label>θ (angle swept): <output id="thetaSweepVal">1.57</output><input id="thetaSweepInput" type="range" min="0" max="6.283" step="0.01" value="1.571" oninput="document.getElementById('thetaSweepVal').value=(+this.value).toFixed(2);update_thetaSweep(+this.value)"></label>
<button onclick="trigger_traceSpiral()">▶ Trace the spiral</button>
<p id="demoNarration" style="margin:0;font-size:10px;max-width:180px">Drag θ: the marker's distance from the origin always equals the angle swept — r = θ, point by point.</p>
